abstract: >
  M31 Autonomous is a terminal-native AI coding agent, written entirely in Go,
  that orchestrates an eight-phase software engineering workflow end-to-end. From
  project initialization through discussion, planning, execution, verification,
  runtime smoke testing, and shipping, every run concludes with a verified git
  commit and a cross-session learning record. The system is distributed as a
  static binary (15-20 MB) with zero runtime dependencies and zero telemetry.
